# 🚀 Git Diff Panel — Performance Optimizations

> **Status**: All 7 planned subtasks implemented (uncommitted). Typecheck green in `@slayzone/worktrees`. **Runtime verification still pending** — no app boot, no E2E, no measured perf. See ⚠️ status section at bottom.

## 🐌 Bottlenecks (ranked)

1. 🗂️ Continuous-flow mounts ALL files simultaneously — no virtualization
2. 🧠 Lezer tokenizer runs on main thread (TSX/TS parser = heavy)
3. 📜 No line-level virtualization inside DiffView
4. 📦 Poll fetches `contextLines: 'all'` every 5s — big patches
5. 🔁 `parseUnifiedDiff` re-parses on every poll (even identical content)
6. ✨ `applyInlineHighlights` runs for every file in patch (even unopened)
7. 🧮 `buildSbsRows` not memoized
8. 🪟 `renderContent` emits many adjacent same-class `<span>`s
9. 👯 Each open task tab = independent poll/parse/tokenize — zero sharing across tabs on same worktree

